        "PWM pins boot LOW; duty cap lives in the lowest PWM-write function",
        "4 encoders × A/B counted by PCNT (no GPIO ISRs); edge timing below 0.1 m/s",
        "18 of 19 safe ESP32 pins used with the MDD3A"
